    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## This workflow will review any current open tasks for you team and escalate them as a reminder for both the owner and the Project Manager. This is a great start for an automated Project Management system.\n\n## ⚙️ How to Setup\n\n* Configure Google Sheets Credentials\n* Configure OpenAI API key in the OpenAI Chat Model node\n* Configure Gmail credentials in the Email Tool node\n* Edit the prompt as needed to fit your specific Project Management and communication style.\n* Edit the spreadsheets as needed to fit your Project Management workflows.\n\n**Adjust the schedule trigger time if needed (default: 9 AM weekdays)**\n\n\n## ℹ️ How to Use\n\nThe workflow runs automatically every weekday morning at 9 AM. It will:\n\n* Review your project management tracker in Google Sheets\n* Identify any overdue tasks\n* Use AI to analyze and classify the urgency of the overdue tasks\n* Escalate the overdue task via email\n* Update an escalation tracker to watch the team's productivity",
        "height": 688,
        "width": 608,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -752,
        -96
      ],
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "id": "5f3f0715-39b9-4e87-95f4-528d4b2fd2f1",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    }
